  "title": "India bloc leaders hold rally to challenge Gyanesh Kumar and demand his resignation",
  "summary": "India bloc leaders in Ramlila Maidan will hold a public rally to challenge the Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, demanding his resignation and press for electoral reforms, as they march alongside crowds opposing the 'vote chori' issue.",
