    {
      "title": "INDIA bloc leaders marches to Ramlila Maidan with crowds marching alongside",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/india-bloc-leaders-marches-to-ramlila-maidan-with-crowds-marching-alongside-126110100353_1.html",
      "description": "INDIA bloc leaders on Sunday moved in an open canter from the Minto Road-Connaught Place junction towards the Ramlila Maidan where they will hold a rally, scaling up their agitation against alleged \"vote chori\" and to press for Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar's resignation.\nLeader of Opposition in the Lok Sabha Rahul Gandhi, Congress general secretary Priyanka Gandhi Vadra, SP chief Akhilesh Yadav, TMC's Mamata Banerjee and Abhishek Banerjee, CPI(M)'s MA Baby, CPI's D Raja, CPI(ML) Liberation general secretary Dipankar Bhattacharya, JKNC's Frooq Abdullah, PDP's Mehbooba Mufti, among others, reached Congress President Mallikarjun Kharge's residence, from where they proceeded to Minto Road in open vehicles.\nFrom there, along with other leaders, they slowly moved towards Ramlila Maidan under the \"Vote Bachao, Desh Bachao' march, with a crowd of supporters and workers walking alongside.\nAmid a sea of flags and banners against Kumar and the Modi government over the issue of \"vo",
